    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay i hear you, but i'm also feeling a bit of a headache and some pressure in my temple. it's probably just stress. if i just keep an eye on it and take some extra strength acetaminophen every few hours, what's the absolute worst case scenario here? like, can it really be anything life threatening if it's just some spots and flashes?",
